   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Clara ne se sent pas bien.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເປັນຫຍັງ? ໜ້າບໍ່ດີ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂ້ອຍເຈັບຫົວແລະເຈັບທ້ອງ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເປັນໄຂ້ບໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ກິນຢາແລ້ວພັກຜ່ອນເດີ</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Romanisation (mots nouveaux)</summary><p><span class=\"rom\">Pěn nyǎng? Nâa bɔ̀ɔ dǐi.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̂ɔy jép-hǔa lɛ́ jép-thȍɔng.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Pěn-khâay bɔ̌ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Nɔ̂ɔy nʉ̀ng.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Kǐn-yǎa lɛ̏ɛw phāk-phɔ̀ɔn dɤ̌ɤ.</span></p></details><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Noy</b> — Qu&#x27;est-ce qui ne va pas ? Tu n&#x27;as pas bonne mine.<br><b>Clara</b> — J&#x27;ai mal à la tête et au ventre.<br><b>Noy</b> — Tu as de la fièvre ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Un peu.<br><b>Noy</b> — Prends un médicament et repose-toi.</p></details>"
